//> 27:15: proved integer overflow in bsearch
//> 28:8: proved index out of bounds in bsearch
//> 28:41: proved integer overflow in bsearch
//> 36:24: kept integer overflow in ack (argument), known 1..=2^63
//> 37:28: proved integer overflow in ack
//> 38:9: proved integer overflow in ack
//> 38:23: proved integer overflow in ack
//> 52:20: proved integer overflow in walk
//> 53:13: proved integer overflow in walk
